{"schema":"yw-junior-reading-v1","extractor":"yw-junior-extract-v1","id":"junior-g9-shang-05","book":"g9-shang","title":"我爱这土地","author":"艾青","kind":"lesson","pages":[15],"source":{"editionId":"cn-a8b13ab7-7eef-4dc7-a3c7-8009ba65ce11-2771da91d637","pdfSha256":"2771da91d6373811a7f7307fa122b258f18e4a759b937e68e1e295da9cbde09f","textLayer":"pdf"},"prep":[],"blocks":[{"type":"heading","level":1,"runs":[{"t":"3 我爱这土地"},{"n":"n1"}],"page":15},{"type":"figure","page":15,"box":[0.085,0.0753,0.2728,0.2629],"caption":[{"t":"艾青"}]},{"type":"para","style":"fs","runs":[{"t":"艾青"}],"page":15,"left":2.5},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"假如我是一只鸟，"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"我也应该用嘶哑的喉咙歌唱："}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"这被暴风雨所打击着的土地，"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"这永远汹涌着我们的悲愤的河流，"}],"page":15,"side":[[{"t":"注意“喉咙”“土"}]]},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"这无止息地吹刮着的激怒的风，"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"地”“河流”“风”“黎"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"和那来自林间的无比温柔的黎明……"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"明”的修饰语，体会"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"——然后我死了，"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"它们带给你的阅读感"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"连羽毛也腐烂在土地里面。"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"受；再试着给这几行"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"kai","runs":[{"t":"诗句标出重音和节奏。"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"为什么我的眼里常含泪水？"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song","runs":[{"t":"因为我对这土地爱得深沉……"}],"page":15},{"type":"para","style":"song small","runs":[{"t":"1938年11月17日"}],"page":15}],"sections":[{"title":"读读写写","blocks":[{"type":"figure","page":15,"box":[0.0761,0.6825,0.8809,0.7346],"caption":[]}]}],"notes":[{"id":"n1","label":"1","page":15,"runs":[{"t":"选自《艾青诗选》（人民文学出版社1984 年号海澄，浙江金华人，诗人。代表作有《大堰版）。艾青（1910—1996），原名蒋正涵，河——我的保姆》《光的赞歌》《向太阳》等。"}]}]}
